Z||000004||watts||11-18-2001||06:30 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Banzai:<BR><B>I will be putting it in an 84'.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Don't forget that the 84 cradle isn't set up to accept a V6.  Or do you have a later one to use?<BR> <BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><B>The oil sending unit is on a tube near the front of the motor. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Just means that the V6 had A/C on it.  Otherwise, it threaded into the block above the oil filter.<P><BR>------------------<BR>87/88 V6 5spd Notchback Hybrid<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/watts_sig.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by watts (edited 11-18-2001).]||||reg||1
